# Order 371393649 is created for sum 22.40;
# Order 371393649 is finished BUT we fail to charge amount from user’s card. Thus we decide to place -22.40 to user’s debt on Balance;
# Order 371487319 started. Its original order amount is 10.90. We add 22.40 debt to that amount and book 33.30 from user’s card. User’s Balance however still remains to be -22.40 (because we only booked debt from card, haven’t charged yet);
# We finally manage to charge 22.40 for order 371393649. We cover the debt and Balance becomes zero;
# Order 371487319 price gets adjusted for 0.60 more. Instead of booking more money from user’s card we decrease amount of previous debt taken. So now order is 11.50 plus 21.80 previously accumulated debt. Thus booked amount doesn’t change and remains 33.30;
# Order 371487319 is finished and we successfully charge user’s card for whole amount of 33.30. Because we overcharge 21.80 we place this amount on user’s Balance;
# User receives partial refund 8.20 for order 371393649 to her Balance. I don’t know why we show card symbol. It’s a bug :( User’s Balance becomes 21.80+8.20=30.00 gbp;
# Order 373133903 gets created. After it finishes we are able to successfully take whole amount from Balance. User’s Balance becomes 30.00-28.90 (order amount) = 1.10 gbp.

